-- src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:454 | (c) bandwidth of more than 50 MHz ––
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:455 | (i) ISM Band: $150
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:456 | (ii) Non-ISM Band: $300
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:457 | 4. Fees for a block of assigned frequencies for multi-channel
-- src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:458 | radio-communication networks and systems: $15.”.
@ref Rg 5 First Schedule as amended by S 100/2016 (src:TA1999-RG5-S100-2016:181-458)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the licence is an Amateur Station Licence of the General Class` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `A fee for a period`
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part II item 3 (from 1 April 2016): the fee for an Amateur Station Licence` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           IF `the licence is an Amateur Station Licence of the General Class` THEN JUST (`A fee for a period` OF 100, 5)
           OTHERWISE JUST (`A fee for a period` OF 50, 5)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part III item 1 (from 1 April 2016): the fee per frequency in dollars, commonly assigned frequencies (temporary or occasional use)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST 100

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part III item 2 (from 1 April 2016): the fee per frequency in dollars, all other frequencies (including satellite downlink frequencies)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST 300

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER, b IS A NUMBER, c IS A NUMBER, d IS A NUMBER, e IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` MEANS
    BRANCH IF x AT MOST 25 THEN a
           IF x AT MOST 500 THEN b
           IF x AT MOST 10000 THEN c
           IF x AT MOST 20000 THEN d
           OTHERWISE e

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `basis of use` IS A STRING
      service IS A STRING
      `radio frequency band` IS A STRING
      `occupied bandwidth in kHz` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part IV items 1 and 2 (from 1 April 2016): the fee per frequency per annum in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "exclusive") AND (service EQUALS "Broadcasting") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN
               (BRANCH IF `occupied bandwidth in kHz` AT MOST 25 THEN JUST 400
                       IF `occupied bandwidth in kHz` AT MOST 500 THEN JUST 800
                       IF `occupied bandwidth in kHz` AT MOST 10000 THEN JUST 12100
                       OTHERWISE NOTHING)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "exclusive") AND (service EQUALS "Public Mobile Radio") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN
               JUST (7700 TIMES (FLOOR ((`occupied bandwidth in kHz` PLUS 4999) DIVIDED BY 5000)))
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "exclusive") AND (service EQUALS "Fixed") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 400 1100 2900 7700 10700)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "exclusive") AND (service EQUALS "Private Mobile Radio") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 400 500 9200 29800 44500)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "exclusive") AND (service EQUALS "Others") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 400 1100 15100 29800 44500)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Fixed") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "Below 10GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 800 1800 2400)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Fixed") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "10GHz to 15.7GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 500 900 1200)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Fixed") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "15.7GHz to 21.2GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 500 700 900)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Fixed") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "Above 21.2GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 500 600 700)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Radiodetermination (Non-aeronautical)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "Below 3GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 1800 3200 4700)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Radiodetermination (Non-aeronautical)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "3GHz to 5.85GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 1000 1800 2500)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Radiodetermination (Non-aeronautical)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "Above 5.85GHz") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 700 1000 1400)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Radiodetermination (Aeronautical)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 2100 4000 5800)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Satellite (Geostationary Orbit)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 700 1000 1600)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Satellite (Non-Geostationary Orbit)") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 1500 2800 4700)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Private Mobile Radio") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 400 2500 7600 11300)
           IF (`basis of use` EQUALS "shared") AND (service EQUALS "Others") AND (`radio frequency band` EQUALS "All Frequency Bands") THEN JUST (`Rg 5 five-tier annual fee` `occupied bandwidth in kHz` 300 500 4000 7700 11300)
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `bandwidth in MHz` IS A NUMBER
      `the frequency is in the ISM Band` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part IV item 3 (from 1 April 2016): the fee per annum in dollars, common frequencies for in-building or on-site wireless systems` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`Rg 5 First Schedule Part IV item 3: the fee per annum in dollars, common frequencies for in-building or on-site wireless systems` `bandwidth in MHz` `the frequency is in the ISM Band`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 5 First Schedule Part IV item 4 (from 1 April 2016): the fee in dollars, block of assigned frequencies for multi-channel radio-communication networks and systems` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2016) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST 15
